## What <%= app_title %> is

_One paragraph: what the product does, who uses it, who pays._

## Tenancy — the one structural decision

_What is a tenant here: an organisation, a workspace, a person? Can a user belong to more than one?_

Every model in a Magik app is auto-scoped by `tenant_id` and every primary key is UUIDv7. This
decision therefore shapes every table, every scope and every screen, and it is the most expensive
one to change later. Write the answer down even if it seems obvious.

